WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[A soft, steady tone. Warm threads form a sunlit landscape.]

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
[The view slowly draws closer to the ridgeline.]

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[Muted green contours emerge beneath the woven sky.]

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
[A steady tone continues. Fine lines trace the hills.]

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
[Blue-gray shadows settle across a darker landscape.]

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
[The contours slowly draw nearer.]

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
[The landscape returns to a warm evening palette.]

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
[The quiet tone fades. The last threads hold the light.]
